WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.677
Week 12: Shopping, Clothing, and Demonstratives. ask for an item and size compare price and fit return or exchange a purchase

2
00:00:08.677 --> 00:00:31.148
Read for the situation. Nora necesita ropa para una entrevista. Esta chaqueta le queda bien, pero es cara. Encuentra otra más barata y pregunta si puede devolverla con el recibo. Nora needs clothes for an interview. This jacket fits her well, but it is expensive. She finds a cheaper one and asks whether she can return it with the receipt.

3
00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:40.038
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:40.038 --> 00:00:47.861
Reading activities. Reading activity 27; Reading activity 28; Reading activity 29

5
00:00:47.861 --> 00:00:56.047
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:56.047 --> 00:01:25.100
Model language. Nora necesita ropa para una entrevista. — Nora needs clothes for an interview. Esta chaqueta le queda bien, pero es cara. — This jacket fits her well, but it's expensive. Encuentra otra más barata. — She finds a cheaper one. Pregunta si puede cambiarla con el recibo. — She asks if she can exchange it with the receipt. La política de la tienda permite cambios. — The store's policy allows exchanges.

7
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:35.105
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
